    <string name="est_mis_pesos">My weights</string>
    <string name="est_mis_pesos_intro">Updates on its own when you log weight in a session, and you can edit it here. That way you don\'t have to remember what you used.</string>
    <string name="est_mis_pesos_aviso">This keeps the HIGHEST weight from your last session, the one to use next: if today you did 10, 12 and 11 kg, you\'ll see 12. Your PR (the most you\'ve ever lifted) shows under each exercise.</string>
